{{Quote|Transforms the user into a venomous hydra, granting the user poison-based attacks that damage over time.|Shop}}
'''Venom''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that used to cost {{Money|3,000,000}} or {{Robux|2,450}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Venom allows the user to control and manipulate venomous sludge, dealing poisonous damage to enemies. The user can transform into a giant humanoid hydra that deals large poisonous damage.

